  "description": "Musamam White Intense is a refined and modern fragrance that blends fresh spices, creamy woods, and soft musky warmth into a clean luxurious scent. The fragrance feels smooth, elegant, and versatile with a fresh woody profile balanced by subtle sweetness and depth. The opening introduces bergamot, orange, and spices, creating a bright citrus freshness layered with warm aromatic energy. The heart develops into coconut, ylang-ylang, ambroxan, and mahonial, adding creamy tropical softness balanced by airy modern woods and smooth floral nuances. The base settles into sandalwood, musk, and benzoin, leaving a creamy woody trail that feels clean, comforting, and long-lasting. Musamam White Intense is perfect for those who enjoy fresh woody fragrances with creamy musky warmth and an elegant modern niche-style character.",
